<title>USA: Magellan Petroleum Corp year full results.</title>
<headline>Magellan Petroleum Corp year full results.</headline>
<dateline>MADISON, Conn. 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>MAGELLAN PETROLEUM CORPORATION</p>
<p>			Consolidated Statement of Operations</p>
<p>					     Year ended June 30,</p>
<p>					1996	   1995	   1994</p>
<p> Total Revenues	    18,073,018   15,423,972   13,317,729</p>
<p> Total Cost &amp; Expenses   13,881,386   10,258,991   10,638,586</p>
<p>Income before minority interests</p>
<p>   and taxes		  4,191,632    5,164,981    2,678,133</p>
<p>Minority interests in MPAL</p>
<p>				(2,507,274)  (2,965,605)  (1,973,352)</p>
<p> Income before taxes	1,684,358    2,199,376	704,781</p>
<p>   Income tax provision     803,752    1,378,533	202,913</p>
<p> Net Income		     880,606	820,843	501,868</p>
<p>Average number of shares</p>
<p>   outstanding	     24,599,899   24,421,309   24,382,291</p>
<p> Net income per share	    0.04	   0.03	   0.02</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
